        "id": 1552902
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-10T03:45:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s right, the changes are too big to simply override ruff as is for the user. I didn\u0027t really come up with any better name but then again I don\u0027t expect user to ever use it directly besides `git cl format` and chromium extensions.",
